<title>ESTONIA: HOIU LIISING TO ISSUE 150 MLN KROONS IN CPS.</title>
<headline>HOIU LIISING TO ISSUE 150 MLN KROONS IN CPS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hoiupank Liising, the leasing subsidiary of Hoiupank , said on Wednesday it plans to issue 150 million kroons of commercial papers during the next three years.</p>
<p>&quot;We will make a new issue after every three or six months,&quot; chairman Andres Eesmaa told a news conference.</p>
<p>The leasing company will on Friday issue its first three-months commercial paper worth 30 million kroons with a yield of 7.10 percent.</p>
<p>Eesmaa said the company will also sign a three million mark loan deal with Schleswig Holstein Landesbank at the end of June.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
